1.COUNT ODD AND EVEN
Given an array arr[] of positive integers. The task is to return the count of the number of odd and even elements in the array.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public int[] countOddEven(int[] arr) {
                int even=0,odd=0;
                for(int i=0;i<arr.length;i++){
                    if(arr[i]%2==0){
                        even++;
                    }
                    else{
                        odd++;
                    }
                }
                return new int[]{odd,even};
            }
        }
PROBLEM LINK : https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/count-odd-even/1


