5.ARRAY END INSERT
Given an array arr that is not completely filled and a value val, you have to insert the value at the end of the array.
SOURCE CODE : 
        class Solution {
            public void insertAtEnd(ArrayList<Integer> arr, int val) {
                arr.add(arr.size(),val);
            }
        }
